What we are using:
------------------
Chat -> Gemini
Embedding -> Gemini
Vector DB -> Qdrant
Memory -> JDBC

---------------------------------------------

Steps to run this application:
------------------------------
1. open Docker Desktop
2. run following command in terminal to start Qdrant container:
docker run -p 6333:6333 -p 6334:6334 qdrant/qdrant
3. (Optional) In the browser: http://localhost:6333/dashboard#/collections
4. Start The Application
5. Test using Swagger UI: http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui/index.html#/
